  "title": "Earth Day: Doing Our Part for People and the Planet",
  "summary": "On this Earth Day, and every day, we recognize that clean, available water and energy are foundational elements of a healthy planet and support resilient, sustainable business. Today, I’m pleased to highlight the progress Pentair has made with its Sustainability Strategic Targets, as announced in our recent 2025 Sustainability Report, which are helping to create a better, more sustainable planet.",
